about=hero("About us","About Lorenzo's Dog Training Team","A mission-driven dog training company built on childhood passion, professional study, serious technique, and serious results.")+f'''<section class="section" id="about-us"><div class="container split"><div><span class="eyebrow">About Us</span><h2>Serious Training. Serious Results.</h2><p>Lorenzo's Dog Training Team helps dogs of any age, size, breed, and temperament become more reliable in real life. The mission is practical: keep dogs out of shelters and in safe, happy homes by teaching owners leadership, rules, boundaries, and clear communication.</p><ul class="check-list"><li>Dog obedience training and advanced off-leash obedience.</li><li>Dog behavior modification for difficult or unsafe habits.</li><li>Specialty, service, assistance, protection, scent, utility, and retrieval training.</li><li>Trainer education through an Academy / Certification path.</li></ul></div><figure class="photo-card"><img src="{IMG["story"]}" alt="Lorenzo's Dog Training Team story"></figure></div></section>'''+technique_section()+f'''<section class="section soft" id="founder"><div class="container founder-grid"><figure class="photo-card"><img src="https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5cb9fbd5c2ff6135a509b1a3/4843ad28-7321-43f3-a4f0-4a33f07ae4a2/Lorenzo-Miller-360.jpg" alt="Lorenzo Miller founder"></figure><div><span class="eyebrow">About the Founder</span><h2>Lorenzo Miller</h2><p>Lorenzo Miller's journey with dogs began as a child in the inner city, where he developed deep compassion for stray dogs and an early ability to calm and understand them. By age ten, his parents recognized that his interest was more than a phase and connected him with professional dog trainers.</p><p>Through the 1970s and 1980s, Lorenzo studied obedience, behavior, communication, structure, and multiple professional training methods. He paid his way through college with in-home dog training and refined a distinct approach built on clarity, accountability, timing, leadership, and transformation between dog and owner.</p><p>In 1987, Lorenzo incorporated Lorenzo's Dog Training Team. Since then, he has trained thousands of dogs and developed trainers who carry the same mission: serious training, serious results, and practical help for families who want safe, reliable, happy dogs.</p><a class="btn btn-red" href="contact.html">Book an Evaluation</a></div></div></section><section class="section navy"><div class="container split"><div><h2 style="color:white">Keep dogs in safe, happy homes.</h2><p style="color:#d8e3f1">The method teaches communication, owner leadership, rules, boundaries, and follow-through so families can build lasting relationships with their dogs.</p></div><a class="btn btn-red" href="dog-training.html">Explore Dog Training</a></div></section>'''
